sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as KubeRay Webhooks<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    participant Operator as KubeRay Operator<br/>controller-runtime
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant GwAPI as Gateway API
    participant Pods as Ray Head/Worker Pods
    participant SecProxy as Security Proxy<br/>Token Auth
    participant APIServer as KubeRay API Server<br/>gRPC:8887 / HTTP:8888
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>8080/HTTP

    Note over User,Prom: Flow 1: RayCluster Lifecycle

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply RayCluster CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission: mutate-ray-io-v1-raycluster<br/>POST /mutate-ray-io-v1-raycluster (TLS)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated resource
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission: validate-ray-io-v1-raycluster<br/>POST /validate-ray-io-v1-raycluster (TLS)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validated
    K8sAPI-->>User: RayCluster created

    K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event: RayCluster
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create head Pod<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create worker Pods<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create head Service<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceAccount<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    Operator->>CertMgr: Create Certificate CR<br/>(mTLS controller)
    CertMgr-->>Operator: Certificate issued
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Secret (TLS certs)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy

    Note over User,Prom: Flow 2: RayJob Submission

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply RayJob CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission: validate-ray-io-v1-rayjob<br/>POST /validate-ray-io-v1-rayjob (TLS)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validated
    K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event: RayJob
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/reuse RayCluster
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create batch/v1 Job (submitter)
    Operator->>Pods: Monitor job status
    Pods-->>Operator: Job completed
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Update RayJob status

    Note over User,Prom: Flow 3: RayService with Gateway

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply RayService CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission: validate-ray-io-v1-rayservice<br/>POST /validate-ray-io-v1-rayservice (TLS)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validated
    K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event: RayService
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create RayCluster (owned)
    Operator->>GwAPI: Create/update HTTPRoute
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Service endpoints
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Manage EndpointSlices

    Note over User,Prom: Flow 4: API Server Access

    User->>APIServer: gRPC request :8887<br/>or REST :8888
    APIServer->>APIServer: HTTP Gateway → gRPC (localhost)
    APIServer->>K8sAPI: Reverse proxy to K8s API<br/>ServiceAccount credentials
    K8sAPI-->>APIServer: Response
    APIServer-->>User: Response

    Note over User,Prom: Flow 5: Secure Dashboard Access

    User->>SecProxy: HTTP/gRPC request<br/>Authorization: Bearer token
    SecProxy->>SecProxy: Validate token
    SecProxy->>Pods: Proxy to Ray head node
    Pods-->>SecProxy: Response
    SecProxy-->>User: Response

    Note over User,Prom: Flow 6: Metrics Collection

    Prom->>Operator: GET /metrics<br/>8080/HTTP
    Operator-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
